# Gold identification in the limit

This paper-specific umbrella contains the semantic first layer of E. Mark
Gold's identification model: arbitrary positive texts, complete informants,
the abstract Theorem 7.1, language-specific identification by enumeration,
finite-language learnability, locking sequences, finite tell-tales, and
arbitrary-text nonidentifiability.

